<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-DOUBLES FINALS RESULTS AT FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DOUBLES FINALS RESULTS AT FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the women's doubles final</p>
<p>at the French Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez(U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat  5-Mary</p>
<p>Joe Fernandez/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-2 6-3.</p>
<p>Mixed doubles final (played on Saturday)</p>
<p>16-Rika Hiraki (Japan)/Mahesh Bhupathi (India) beat 1-Lisa</p>
<p>Raymond/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
